  "description": "Reach the highest peaks with ultimate riding fun. Our new ALLMTN CF 11 TRN/IQ delivers just that – and even more. This full-suspension eMTB embodies “Next Level Riding” like no other eMountain bike in our range. One key feature is the fully integrated Pinion Motor.Gearbox.Unit (MGU) – an advanced drive technology that combines motor and gearbox in one housing. Supported by the mullet setup, shorter chain stays and improved kinematics with 160mm of travel front and rear, you’ll enjoy an entirely new, intuitive riding experience. And with the 800Wh battery, even the longest Alpine climbs become a breeze, while the high-quality Magura disc brakes bring you safely back down to the valley. Climbing to the highest peaks has never been this fun!",
